umbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**.\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $14$ is a positive whole number, so it belongs to $N.$ We can write\n\n$$\n14\\in N\n$$\n\n- Every natural number is an integer, rational, real, and complex number. Consequently, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}14\\in Z\\qquad 14\\in Q \\\\ 14\\in R\\qquad 14\\in C\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $N, Z, Q, R, C$."] [:db/add "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/answer-fields "60608016-edaa-58ad-9f98-22cf0c3bf796"] [:db/add "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/answer-fields "87458230-d383-5b19-91f3-b3ab652a839e"] [:db/add "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/answer-fields "0e8fddd3-aaee-50f0-a6a8-eaed00675aa7"] [:db/add "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/answer-fields "af3243f1-243f-5975-9e32-67167c25502b"] [:db/add "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/answer-fields "c20047eb-5400-5ed9-bca1-50d8c10335c2"] [:db/ensure "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054814 :knowledge-point/questions "cdc66198-5eb8-5264-9ff6-2849efaaf195"] [:db/add "c1fd4c98-1e3c-591b-8d7e-9a068012005b" :answer/id #uuid "c1fd4c98-1e3c-591b-8d7e-9a068012005b"] [:db/add "c1fd4c98-1e3c-591b-8d7e-9a068012005b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "c1fd4c98-1e3c-591b-8d7e-9a068012005b" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "c1fd4c98-1e3c-591b-8d7e-9a068012005b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fee18765-68f7-5261-acb0-be05969ee6bd" :answer/id #uuid "fee18765-68f7-5261-acb0-be05969ee6bd"] [:db/add "fee18765-68f7-5261-acb0-be05969ee6bd" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "fee18765-68f7-5261-acb0-be05969ee6bd" :answer/v