:db/add "36b38c97-6274-57a7-8864-4b64c37ca47b" :answer-field/correct "0512ad6c-caa6-56c7-8b05-a754ce853945"] [:db/ensure "36b38c97-6274-57a7-8864-4b64c37ca47b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/id #uuid "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8"] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/problem "To which of the following sets does the number $\\sqrt{100}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**.\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- The number $\\sqrt{100}=10$ is a positive whole number, so it belongs to $N.$ We can write\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{100}\\in N\n$$\n\n- Every natural number is an integer, rational, real, and complex number. Consequently, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\sqrt{100}\\in Z\\qquad \\sqrt{100}\\in Q \\\\ \\sqrt{100}\\in R\\qquad \\sqrt{100}\\in C\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $N, Z, Q, R, C$."] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/answer-fields "9b8383e1-b51c-5648-b2c8-9d6292965070"] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/answer-fields "9ab7ef89-2733-599e-85fb-be0f0fc259c0"] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/answer-fields "ef4764ab-77be-5084-8558-7b87cfeb8ae1"] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/answer-fields "37e53044-c6a4-53bd-a9b6-97d42def86ca"] [:db/add "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/answer-fields "36b38c97-6274-57a7-8864-4b64c37ca47b"] [:db/ensure "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054814 :knowledge-point/questions "2ca51076-7b06-5249-8d93-12a62513b1f8"] [:db/add "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40" :answer/id #uuid "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40"] [:db/add "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40" :answer/validate] [:db/add "add67cce-b621-5361-8299-aaa416524dc0" :answer/id #uuid "add67cce-b621-5361-8299-aaa416524dc0"] [:db/add "add67cce-b621-5361-8299-aaa416524dc0" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "add67cce-b621-5361-8299-aaa416524dc0" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "add67cce-b621-5361-8299-aaa416524dc0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/id #uuid "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5"] [:db/add "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/key "Integers ($Z$)"] [:db/add "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/choices "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40"] [:db/add "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/choices "add67cce-b621-5361-8299-aaa416524dc0"] [:db/add "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/correct "a8615958-f70d-5f83-a59d-8402670aad40"] [:db/ensure "4f95145a-790e-54d9-82af-5f6f8dc5caf5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1640326e-dd75-5e0c-9e9c-a86146677d31" :answer/id #uuid "1640326e-dd75-5e0c-9e9c-a86146677d31"] [:db/add "1640326e-dd75-5e0c-9e9c-a86146677d31" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "1640326e-dd75-5e0c-9e9c-a86146677d31" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "1640326e-dd75-5e0c-9e9c-a86146677d31" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4855231f-f9da-51a1-b1d0-e8baaba37a67" :answer/id #uuid "4855231f-f9da-51a1-b1d0-e8baaba37a67"] [:db/add "4855231f-f9da-51a1-b1d0-e8baaba37a67" :answe